WEBVTT

00:00:28.453 --> 00:00:30.058
What you can see over here is Tamara,

00:00:30.058 --> 00:00:31.873
who is holding my phone that's now plugged in.

00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:33.809
So let me start with this.

00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:35.377
What we have here is a painting

00:00:35.377 --> 00:00:37.633
of the great poet Rabbie Burns,

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:39.450
and it's just a normal image,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.841
but if we now switch inputs over to the phone,

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.066
running our technology, you can see

00:00:44.066 --> 00:00:46.408
effectively what Tamara's seeing on the screen,

00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:47.961
and when she points at this image,

00:00:47.961 --> 00:00:50.178
something magical happens.

00:00:50.178 --> 00:00:54.540
(Laughter) (Bagpipes)

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.148
(Bagpipes) (Applause)

00:00:57.148 --> 00:01:04.028
(Bagpipes)